UnitVoterPaymentsModule::depositIntoNFT
├── when sources is empty
│   └── it should revert with NoSources
├── when any source authorization check fails
│   └── it should revert with NotApprovedByOwner
└── when every source authorization passes
    ├── when the operation is restricted and the caller is unregistered
    │   └── it should revert with NotRegistered
    └── when the operation is permissionless or the caller is registered
        ├── when the destination is the mint sentinel
        │   ├── when the net mint amount is zero
        │   │   └── it should revert with ZeroMintAmount
        │   └── when the net mint amount is nonzero
        │       ├── it should pass recipient through to VE
        │       └── it should emit DepositedIntoNFT with the resolved destination id
        ├── when the destination is the accumulator
        │   └── it should emit DepositedIntoNFT
        └── when the destination is an existing tokenId
            ├── when fee is zero
            │   ├── it should drop the fee leg from the VE destinations
            │   └── it should emit DepositedIntoNFT with fee zero
            ├── when fee is nonzero
            │   └── it should emit DepositedIntoNFT
            └── when sources span a fuzzed length
                └── it should accumulate totalIn across every source leg
